  "text": "### 4. Meeting Schedule & Procedures  \n**Frequency:**\n- Quarterly (minimum) — scheduled meetings\n- Emergency meetings as needed (within 24 hours if critical risk)  \n**Attendance:**\n- All voting members expected to attend (min. 3 per meeting)\n- Executive attendees as needed\n- Advisors as needed (legal, external risk consultants)\n- External auditors invited (at least annually)\n- Internal auditors invited (at least quarterly)  \n**Agenda Setting:**\n- Chair sets agenda (input from CRO, CFO, Compliance)\n- Standing items: Risk appetite, capital ratios, incidents, KRIs\n- Advance notice: Agenda and papers provided 5 days before meeting  \n**Meeting Minutes:**\n- Recorded by Committee Secretary\n- Minutes approved by Chair within 5 days\n- Distributed to all Board members\n- Retained for 7 years  \n**Confidentiality:**\n- Committee discussions confidential (unless public disclosure required)\n- Executive session (without management) held quarterly\n- Minutes protected as Board materials (legal privilege)",
